[18.463752, "o", "\u00b7 Scanning repository\r\n\u00b7 Walking repository \u2014 Walked 22 entries\r\n\u00b7 Matching bundled rulesets\r\n\u00b7 Scanning for agent-hygiene antipatterns \u2014 Antipattern scan complete\r\n\u00b7 Blaming candidate sources for stale TODOs \u2014 Marker prefilter matched 1 of 3 files\r\n\u00b7 Computing blame for marker hits \u2014 0 stale markers across 0 files\r\nFound 3 proposals (sorted by confidence):\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[32m\u2713\u001b[0m \u001b[2m[\u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[32m  high\u001b[0m\u001b[2m]\u001b[0m alint://bundled/monorepo/cargo-workspace@v1\r\n    Workspace-flavor overlay.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[32m\u2713\u001b[0m \u001b[2m[\u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[32m  high\u001b[0m\u001b[2m]\u001b[0m alint://bundled/monorepo@v1\r\n    Workspace-tier monorepo \u2014 extend the generic monorepo ruleset.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[36m\u00b7\u001b[0m \u001b[2m[\u001b[0m\u001b[36mmedium\u001b[0m\u001b[2m]\u001b[0m alint://bundled/agent-hygiene@v1\r\n    Agent-hygiene leftovers detected \u2014 bundled ruleset would catch them.\r\n\r\n\u001b[2mRun with --format yaml to print as a config snippet.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mRun with --explain to see file-level evidence.\u001b[0m\r\nalint: 3 proposals (2 high, 1 medium) \u2014 0.0s\r\n"]
